      "post_id": "90990",
      "author_handle": "Stephwarbe",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 8 years 3 months ago",
      "body": "Hi mums and dads,\nI hope you don’t mind me posting here, I’m trying to raise awareness of a recall issued by iCandy. They haven’t been very forthcoming with it and have hidden the info on their website. My baby was hurt when he fell from his pram, hitting his head in the road when the safety harness failed. I have put a post together on medium with all the facts. Please read it, like it (you can do this up to 50 times) and then repost it. I don’t want any more babies to be injured. Thank you\nI can’t post link to article on this post, just parents don’t allow it",
